			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement terminal shell integration and process IPC\n\nAdd terminal shell integration event handlers (`setShellIntegrationActive`, `setCwd`) that forward OSC 633 sequences from Sky's terminal bridge to Cocoon via gRPC notifications, enabling `terminal.shellIntegration` and `shellIntegration.cwd` in the extension host.\n\nPersist the shell's current working directory in ApplicationState so `refreshProperty(PropId=0)` returns it without probing the OS process. Implement process introspection IPC handlers (`getPlatform`, `getArch`, `getPid`, `getExecPath`, `getMemoryInfo`, `getCpuInfo`) for Wind's shared-process diagnostics and About dialog.\n\nDifferentiate NotFound errors from generic IO failures across `FileReadNative`, `FileReaddirNative`, and `FileStatNative` by suffixing \"resource not found\" on ENOENT, allowing Wind's file-system error classifier to map to `FileSystemError.FileNotFound`.\n\nFix the language configuration Tauri event emission in both Dispatcher and SkyEmit to forward the full params object (language + rules) instead of only the language string, so Sky's Monaco bridge receives actual bracket/comment/indentation rules.",
			"SHA": "0f6240bef82f03217077bd32bc12c670d9ef27ff"
