			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Code quality improvements and refactoring\n\nThis commit refactors internal module structures and improves code organization across multiple files in the Mountain backend. Removed unnecessary blank lines and consolidated imports for consistency.\n\nSpecifically, this change enhances readability and maintainability by ensuring consistent code style and reducing visual clutter. No functional changes were made.",
